      "id": "CVE-2026-19447",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-18T10:53:16.719Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-18T10:53:16.719Z",
      "description": "Improper neutralization of input during web page generation ('cross-site scripting') vulnerability in Fileorbis Informatics Services Trade Inc. FileOrbis allows Stored XSS.\n\nThis issue affects FileOrbis: before 16.5.",
      "severity": 5.4,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Fileorbis Informatics Services Trade Inc. FileOrbis\n🔓 漏洞类型：Cross-site Scripting (XSS) (CWE-79)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://siberguvenlik.gov.tr/guvenlik-bildirimleri/detay/tr-26-0850",
          "type": "reference"
        }
